Package: com.551.glowiconposition
Name: GlowIconPosition
Version: 1.1.10
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Moves all Glow notification icons up or down together from Settings and sets Glow's Notification Icon Scale default to 2.20 with a maximum of 3.0.
